      "text": "  prior art at this boundary\n  Inspect bridge: routed calls; hosted-tool grants\n  OTel GenAI: redacted span projection (dev)\n  LangSmith/Langfuse: OTLP ingest, check freshness\n  Phoenix / Weave: spans + annotations\n  rLLM gateway: token IDs/logprobs/session + SSE\n  (vLLM return_token_ids; SGLang unproven; borrow, not adopted)",
